    "finalSystemDirective": "<user_input>\n$8\n</user_input>\n\n以上是用户的本轮输入。\n\n{{recall}}\n\n{{thugSpawn}}\n\n{{thugAction}}\n\n{{prologue}}\n\n{{plot}}\n\n请参考以上指导编排这一幕正文♡\n",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "id": "mainPrompt",
        "name": "主系统提示词 (通用)",
